---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Local pairing authority foundation; remote hosting is not yet available

Usage: mxr serve [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  status   Inspect local identity; hosting is not yet available
  pair     Inspect or approve local pairing requests
  clients  List registered clients, or preview/revoke one
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Structured output (json or jsonl) [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
